    "├── lexical_features.csv    ← Step 2: word length, wiki freq, AoA, bigram probs\n",
    "└── syntactic_features.csv  ← Step 3: PCFG surprisal, entropy, embedding depth\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "To run these locally (not in Colab), follow the README instructions."
